ntracts or Programs","description":"The increase (decrease) during the period in the carrying amount of inventory pertaining to construction, development, or other contracts or programs that initially were expected to take more than one year or the normal operating cycle to complete.","units":{"CAD":[{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2024"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":2842794,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":2842794,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2025"}]}},"IncreaseDecreaseInMarketableSecuritiesRestricted":{"label":"Increase (Decrease) in Marketable Securities, Restricted","description":"The change during the period, either increase or decrease, in total debt and equity financial instruments including: (1) securities held-to-maturity, (2) trading securities, and (3) securities available-for-sale that are pledged to one or more secured parties who have the right to buy, sell, or re-pledge the collateral.","units":{"CAD":[{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2024"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":9233029,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":9233029,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2025"}]}},"InventoryNet":{"label":"Inventory, Net","description":"Amount after valuation and LIFO reserves of inventory expected to be sold, or consumed within one year or operating cycle, if longer.","units":{"CAD":[{"end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2024Q4I"},{"end":"2025-12-31","val":2842794,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"end":"2025-12-31","val":2842794,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2025Q4I"}]}},"MarketableSecurities":{"label":"Marketable Securities","description":"Amount of investment in marketable security.","units":{"CAD":[{"end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"end":"2024-12-31","val":0,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2024Q4I"},{"end":"2025-12-31","val":9093887,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"end":"2025-12-31","val":9093887,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2025Q4I"}]}},"OtherNonoperatingIncomeExpense":{"label":"Other Nonoperating Income (Expense)","description":"Amount of income (expense) related to nonoperating activities, classified as other.","units":{"CAD":[{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":-1446748,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":-1446748,"accn":"0001376474-26-000330","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-05-04","frame":"CY2024"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":-19877279,"accn":"0001376474-26-000322","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F/A","filed":"2026-04-29"},{"start